  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.26,
      "e": 3.24,
      "text": "- Sometimes you can get this feeling of vertigo, I guess,"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.24,
      "e": 5.75,
      "text": "where your mind does this little flippy flop"
    },
    {
      "s": 5.75,
      "e": 8.41,
      "text": "and you kind of just gotta get your bearings again."
    },
    {
      "s": 8.41,
      "e": 9.93,
      "text": "Might get a little bit of a headache,"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.93,
      "e": 13.32,
      "text": "but, I mean, after a time, you get your sea legs"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.32,
      "e": 16.39,
      "text": "and it's just walking per normal."
    },
    {
      "s": 16.39,
      "e": 19.11,
      "text": "Except, sometimes you might be almost"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.11,
      "e": 22.31,
      "text": "walking on the walls in rougher seas."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.31,
      "e": 25.27,
      "text": "- Unfortunately, I suffer from motion sickness,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.27,
      "e": 28.06,
      "text": "car, airplane, the whole shebang."
    },
    {
      "s": 28.06,
      "e": 30.1,
      "text": "I don't notice the swaying that much"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.1,
      "e": 31.81,
      "text": "cause you're always busy walking around,"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.81,
      "e": 33.41,
      "text": "you don't notice the ship moving"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.41,
      "e": 35.45,
      "text": "or you moving side to side."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.45,
      "e": 38.98,
      "text": "You just get used to it, you get your sea legs, essentially."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.98,
      "e": 41.41,
      "text": "Once we start hitting those rougher waves,"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.41,
      "e": 43.25,
      "text": "you definitely feel it."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.25,
      "e": 45.62,
      "text": "I always have this in my pocket."
    },
    {
      "s": 45.62,
      "e": 48.37,
      "text": "Dramamine, it's for motion sickness."
    },
    {
      "s": 48.37,
      "e": 52.41,
      "text": "I take it all the time, cause it gets pretty bad,"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.41,
      "e": 54.68,
      "text": "especially when we start really rocking."
    },
    {
      "s": 54.68,
      "e": 57.54,
      "text": "The literal sense that people say here is like,"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.54,
      "e": 59.41,
      "text": "\"You will walk on walls.\""
    },
    {
      "s": 59.41,
      "e": 62.63,
      "text": "You will literally see people leaning, walking on walls."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.63,
      "e": 64.57,
      "text": "That's how bad the ship rocks and stuff."
    },
    {
      "s": 64.57,
      "e": 68.47,
      "text": "- After a while, you kind of just acclimate to it"
    },
    {
      "s": 68.47,
      "e": 70.57,
      "text": "and just move along with it."
    },
    {
      "s": 70.57,
      "e": 74.65,
      "text": "(jump rope swishing and tapping)"
    }
  ],
